        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystic Archipelago is an idle RPG where your party automatically battles through dungeons while you watch them grow stronger. Set in mystical islands, your heroes fight through forests and caves without requiring constant input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully automated combat with intelligent AI decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-battle dungeon sequences that run independently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic healing and progression between fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique enemies across two zones: Mystical Forest and Dark Caves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles, including Forest Dragon and Ancient Lich</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-based combat with multiple heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment shop for upgrading gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat enhancement system for permanent improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RPG mechanics with HP, MP, and combat abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interface:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard-only controls for streamlined navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean menu system designed for idle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal interaction is required once dungeons begin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on RPG Maker MZ, this idle RPG offers progression-focused gameplay for players who enjoy watching their party develop over time. Perfect for multitasking or relaxed gaming sessions where the adventure continues automatically.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mystic Archipelago is an idle RPG where your party automatically battles through dungeons while you watch them grow stronger. Set in mystical islands, your heroes fight through forests and caves without requiring constant input.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully automated combat with intelligent AI decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-battle dungeon sequences that run independently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic healing and progression between fights</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique enemies across two zones: Mystical Forest and Dark Caves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss battles, including Forest Dragon and Ancient Lich</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Progression:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Party-based combat with multiple heroes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment shop for upgrading gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat enhancement system for permanent improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic RPG mechanics with HP, MP, and combat abilities</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interface:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard-only controls for streamlined navigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean menu system designed for idle gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimal interaction is required once dungeons begin</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on RPG Maker MZ, this idle RPG offers progression-focused gameplay for players who enjoy watching their party develop over time. Perfect for multitasking or relaxed gaming sessions where the adventure continues automatically.</p>",
